  "description": "<p class='problem-lead'>將一行文字反轉後輸出。</p><p>給定字串 <code>S</code>，請輸出把 <code>S</code> 的字元順序整個反過來的結果；字串中的空格也要一併反轉。字串不含前導或尾端空格。</p>",
  "hint": "<p>可以用切片 <code>S[::-1]</code>，或用迴圈從最後一個字元往前走訪來組出反轉結果。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>一行，包含字串 <code>S</code>。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>輸出 <code>S</code> 反轉後的結果。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>1 ≤ S 的字元數 ≤ 100</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "world",
  "sampleOutput": "dlrow",
  "samples": [
    {"input": "world", "output": "dlrow"},
    {"input": "12345", "output": "54321"},
    {"input": "Hello World", "output": "dlroW olleH"}
